                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "14px",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#123B6D"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "\nBalanced 45 / 25 / 30  ·  Need-focused 60 / 10 / 30\nUncertainty-aware 35 / 35 / 30  ·  Supply-gap-focused 35 / 15 / 50\n(Vulnerability / Blindspot / Supply Gap)\n\nSunset, West Point Grey/Dunbar-Southlands and Oakridge/Marpole remain Top 5 in all four scenarios; Sunset ranks first or second throughout. Rank movement confirms dependence on assumptions—not actual need.",
